CM_ "TunerOS synthetic simulation CAN database. Not BMW, E90, N54, PT-CAN, captured, or reverse-engineered OEM data.";
CM_ BU_ TunerOsSimulatedDme "TunerOS simulated DME publisher; not BMW firmware.";
CM_ BU_ TunerOsSimulatedDsc "TunerOS simulated DSC publisher; no ABS, traction, or stability control behavior.";
